{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02549","headline":"奉和登陕州城楼应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和登陕州城楼应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挹河澂绿宇，御沟映朱宫。\n辰旗翻丽景，星盖曳雕虹。\n学嚬齐柳嫩，妍笑发春藂。\n锦鳞文碧浪，绣羽绚青空。\n眷念三阶静，遥想二南风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}